			"notes": "### added\n\n- **Paws** and **Toe Beans** — two new wearable cat pieces (chestplate + boots slots)\n- Paws silently open chests\n- Toe Beans silence footsteps + let you walk on powder snow\n- continuous **two-color dye system** for all four cat pieces — main + accent colors mixed in a crafting table, vanilla leather-armor formula (replaces the 16 fixed-color items from v0.0.1)\n- **Orange Arrow** — fires from any bow, same effect as Throwable Orange Sauce but with range\n- **Orange Pill** is now dyeable, and eating it self-equips a full cat outfit using the pill's colors\n- **Change** effect — applied when you get hit with Orange Sauce / Arrow / Pill\n- **furrycore recycling loop** — crush cat pieces into Furrycore, then Mixer it into Pure / Unpure Furrynes + Bleach\n- new intermediate crafting items: **Headband**, **Mittens**, **Socks** (sequenced-assembly inputs for the cat pieces)\n- **Accessories** integration — wear the cat pieces in Hat / Belt / Gloves / Shoes slots\n- hides vanilla boots when Toe Beans are worn\n- hides other mods' glove-slot accessories when Paws are worn (e.g. Aether gloves)\n- shifts cat ears up 1px when a helmet is worn underneath\n- full **GitHub wiki** with recipe images and per-feature pages"
		},
